===Etymology===
Via {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|pastiche|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|it|en}} {{term|pasticcio||pie, something blended|lang=it}}, from {{etyl|VL.|en}} {{m|la|*pasticium}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|pasta||dough, pastry cake, paste|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|παστά||barley porridge|tr=pasta|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}, from {{term|παστός||sprinkled with salt|tr=pastos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

