===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[image:Pastiche.jpg|thumb|[[w:Botticelli|Botticelli]]'s original on the left, '''pastiche''' on the right. (1)]]

# A [[work]] of [[art]], [[drama]], [[literature]], [[music]], or [[architecture]] that [[imitate]]s the work of a [[previous]] [[artist]].
# A [[musical]] [[medley]], typically [[quote|quoting]] other works.
# An [[incongruous]] [[mixture]]; a [[hodgepodge]].
# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} A [[postmodern]] [[playwriting]] technique that fuses a variety of styles, genres, and story lines to create a new form.

